      "Section": "Leads Module References",
      "Anchor": "leads-module-references",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "This guide contains a description of the content featured in all components and recommended sizes for various layouts. Descriptions for how to instantiate these components can be found in the Embedding the Iframe documentation.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Leads Module References",
      "Anchor": "leads-module-references",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Below you will find descriptions of the main functionality for a given component. For all components, if a strong match is not found for a given set of query parameters, the user will land on a search results page (the matching page) where they can further refine their search or enter new search terms. After a match is selected, the UI will display the component requested.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
