      "Section": "Top Card",
      "Anchor": "top-card",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Top Card"
      ],
      "Text": "The Top Card displays user profile data for a lead, including name, headline, and role. From this component, users can save, message, or view the lead in Sales Navigator.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
